ARCHITECTURE (mirrors the A7 YearReview / TemperatureImpact / Geofences precedents)
  SharedDrivePageModel.kt      framework-free: registration ids (ROUTE_ID=sharedDrive, ARG_TOKEN=token,
                               WEB_PATH=/s/:token, SLUG); the SI domain model (SharedDrive / SharedDriveInfo /
                               SharedVehicle / SharedElevationPoint / SharedSpeedPoint); parseSharedDrive +
                               readV2/normalizeV1 (web normalizeSharedDriveData — a v2 payload read as SI,
                               a legacy v1 payload upgraded km→m / min→s / km/h→m/s / Wh-km→Wh-m);
                               SharedDriveDisplayPrefs (web useUnits + the inline elevationLabel / efficiencyUnit /
                               convertElevation / toEfficiencyDisplay helpers — distance/speed via the shared SI
                               formatters, elevation→ft and Wh/km→Wh/mi via the inline factors the web keeps);
                               formatDurationSecondsAsMinutes (web dateFormat port); mapData; recordSharedDrivePageOpened.
  SharedDrivePageIcons.kt      MapPin/Clock/Zap=Bolt/Battery/Gauge re-exported from DataDisplayGlyphs; TrendingUp +
                               Mountain authored locally as 24×24 stroked vectors (the LifetimeStatsPageIcons precedent —
                               shared catalogs unedited, out of scope).
  SharedDrivePageSource.kt     seam over container.api (GET /share/{token} via the shared resilient safeRequest,
                               folded to a loading→success/error Resource stream — the TemperatureImpactPageSource
                               inline-read precedent, since the web issues this public read inline through request()
                               and no sharing repository exists) + SettingsStore.settings (web useUnits). No HTTP in the view.
  SharedDrivePageViewModel.kt  BaseFeedViewModel; state: StateFlow<UiState<SharedDrive?>> re-collected on refresh,
                               null decode (web !data) → UiPhase.Empty and transport failure (web error) → UiPhase.Error
                               (both the unavailable surface), a decoded payload → UiPhase.Content; displayPrefs
                               StateFlow (web useUnits); refresh/retry/recordViewOpened. No HTTP in the view.
  SharedDrivePage.kt           stateless content + the report (header, hero map, 7 StatCards, vehicle badge, elevation
                               AreaChart panel, speed LineChart panel, no-route fallback, footer) + the loading spinner +
                               the ExpiredShareView. SI converted to display units only here via SharedDriveDisplayPrefs.
  SharedDrivePageHost.kt       reads the share token from the NavBackStackEntry (web useParams().token), binds the page
                               over container.api + container.settingsStore, registers the host for the `sharedDrive`
                               (/s/:token) standalone public destination (Destinations.kt L181, already present).

WIRING
  - SharedDrivePageHost.register() added to TeslaSyncApplication.onCreate (idempotent; the "NavHost registration" seam).
  - Destination `sharedDrive` ("/s/:token", standalone, public, token arg) already in Destinations.kt L181 +
    TeslaSyncNavHost registers it with its deep link; the host now attaches content.

